{"review_id": "0c3b733b-ed09-4a36-9835-b3349ac709e6", "package": "com.hevy", "app_name": "Hevy - Gym Log Workout Tracker", "language": "sl", "language_name": "sl", "rating": 5, "text": "A very useful app. It offers a wide range of exercises, allowing you to create various workouts according to your preferences. You can see what you did last time, gradually increase the weight of the exercises, and track your progress. The analysis shows how you trained different muscle groups. It's interesting and provides motivation to keep going.", "author": "Bojana Lustrek", "date": "2025-05-11T08:58:34Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "2.2.8", "developer_reply": null}
